{"page":473,"width":1971,"height":2546,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"이제 이 문자열의 접-두부와 접미부 목록-을 차례대로 살펴봅시다. 같은 순서에서 일치하는 접두부와","words":[{"text":"이제","x":197,"y":223,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":283,"y":222,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"문자열의","x":330,"y":222,"width":140,"height":36},{"text":"접-두부와","x":488,"y":222,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"접미부","x":639,"y":223,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"목록-을","x":752,"y":224,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"차례대로","x":863,"y":222,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"살펴봅시다.","x":1006,"y":219,"width":171,"height":37},{"text":"같은","x":1195,"y":218,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"순서에서","x":1271,"y":217,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"일치하는","x":1422,"y":216,"width":141,"height":37},{"text":"접두부와","x":1578,"y":215,"width":158,"height":36}]},{"text":"접미부가 있습니까? 우선 빈 문자열이 일치하는군요. B와A, BA와AA는 일치하지 않고 그 아래에","words":[{"text":"접미부가","x":195,"y":292,"width":145,"height":37},{"text":"있습니까?","x":352,"y":291,"width":160,"height":37},{"text":"우선","x":523,"y":293,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"빈","x":606,"y":293,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"문자열이","x":649,"y":292,"width":133,"height":36},{"text":"일치하는군요.","x":798,"y":291,"width":202,"height":35},{"text":"B와A,","x":1017,"y":289,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"BA와AA는","x":1134,"y":288,"width":183,"height":35},{"text":"일치하지","x":1330,"y":287,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"않고","x":1478,"y":287,"width":73,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":1563,"y":291,"width":39,"height":25},{"text":"아래에","x":1615,"y":286,"width":115,"height":36}]},{"text":"있는 BAA는 일치합니다. 그 외에는 일치하는 접두부와 접미부가 보이지 않습니다.","words":[{"text":"있는","x":194,"y":362,"width":72,"height":36},{"text":"BAA는","x":276,"y":362,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"일치합니다.","x":409,"y":360,"width":180,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":604,"y":365,"width":35,"height":24},{"text":"외에는","x":651,"y":361,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"일치하는","x":763,"y":358,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"접두부와","x":905,"y":358,"width":134,"height":